The size is 1.
The presses is 1.
The patterns is 1.
For every step from 1 to size.
Set patterns to patterns times 2.

The allmask is patterns minus 1.
The evenmask is 0.
The oddmask is 0.
The triplemask is 0.
For every spot from 0 to size minus 1.
The bit is shift 1 left by spot.
If spot modulo 2 is 0, set evenmask to bitwise or of evenmask and bit.
If spot modulo 2 is 1, set oddmask to bitwise or of oddmask and bit.
If spot modulo 3 is 0, set triplemask to bitwise or of triplemask and bit.

The rounds is presses plus 1.
The limit is rounds times patterns.
The seen is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to limit minus 1.
Place 0 into seen.

The queue is an empty list of whole numbers.
The depths is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into queue.
Place 0 into depths.
Set item 0 of seen to 1.
The head is 0.
The count is 1.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The state is item head of queue.
The round is item head of depths.
Add 1 to head.
The flipped is exclusive or of state and allmask.
The flipspot is (round plus 1) times patterns plus flipped.
If round is less than presses and item flipspot of seen is 0, set item flipspot of seen to 1, Place flipped into queue, Place round plus 1 into depths, add 1 to count.
The evenstate is exclusive or of state and evenmask.
The evenspot is (round plus 1) times patterns plus evenstate.
If round is less than presses and item evenspot of seen is 0, set item evenspot of seen to 1, Place evenstate into queue, Place round plus 1 into depths, add 1 to count.
The oddstate is exclusive or of state and oddmask.
The oddspot is (round plus 1) times patterns plus oddstate.
If round is less than presses and item oddspot of seen is 0, set item oddspot of seen to 1, Place oddstate into queue, Place round plus 1 into depths, add 1 to count.
The triplestate is exclusive or of state and triplemask.
The triplespot is (round plus 1) times patterns plus triplestate.
If round is less than presses and item triplespot of seen is 0, set item triplespot of seen to 1, Place triplestate into queue, Place round plus 1 into depths, add 1 to count.

The answer is 0.
For every state from 0 to patterns minus 1.
If item (presses times patterns plus state) of seen is 1, add 1 to answer.

Show answer.
